  "title": "Vegan Pumpkin Cheesecake with Gingersnap Pecan Crust",
  "description": "No one will ever guess this cheesecake, with its silky pumpkin filling and fragrant gingersnap-pecan crust, is vegan and so simple to make!",
  "authors": [
    "SarahRosenkrantz"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:24:00-04:00",
